      <title>
        
          National Park in a City: Mount Rokko (Setonaikai) | National Parks of Japan
        
      </title>
    
    <meta name="description" content="Mount Rokko overlooks Kobe City and offers a combination of lush nature and urban excitement. Visit beautiful botanical gardens, hop on a cable car for stunning night views, or explore hiking trails dotted with waterfalls and shrines.">
